qwen4exp-mtp-draft-subset-head (W7), spec-draft-recent-penalty-default (W8), qwen4exp-ple-release-v2
(W12), qwen4exp-ple-prefetch-ahead (W13), llama-quantize-windows-slab-read (W18), each with anchors,
receipts, quality gate and workload. W9 5c14006cb joins vulkan-qwen4exp-gdn-bank and W16 1c460db02 joins
the existing qwen4exp-qsa-pooled-indexer-cache entry (also_commits). Round-2 commits that are not wins
are covered through also_commits with a NOT-a-win note: the two registration commits join their own
entries, the lane-299 alpha tie joins qwen4exp-layout-copies, the two lane-302 opt-in grid-init arms join
vulkan-moe-gather-slot-major-matvec-id (shader paths and env anchors added). protected-win validate
--draft PASS (cells/r62-pw-validate-draft.txt).

